# Wallet Balance Service Integration Guide

## Service Overview
The wallet balance service is deployed at: `https://walletbalanceservice-455488113475.us-central1.run.app`

## Endpoint Pattern
```
GET /api/v1/chains/{chain}/addresses/{address}/balance
```

